{
  "info": {
    "name": "Barrier — Risk Engine",
    "_postman_id": "b0a11e00-0000-4000-8000-0000000000c1",
    "description": "Roteiro numerado do cadastro ponta a ponta, de preparo a registry de regras.\n\n**Rode as pastas em ordem.** A 01 (webhook) vem antes da 03 (primeira avaliacao) de proposito: a entrega e disparada pela conclusao, e sem endpoint registrado o resultado nao chega a lugar nenhum.\n\nVariaveis obrigatorias antes de comecar: `apiKey` (sai no log da risk-engine no startup, procure por \"API key de DESENVOLVIMENTO\"), `adminKey` e `ngrokUrl`.\n\nDetalhes em `docs/api/README.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Preparo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00.1 — Health da Risk Engine",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('UP', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP'));",
                  "// A watchlist derruba o health quando a importacao falhou (WatchlistHealthIndicator).",
                  "// DOWN aqui significa screening sem cobertura — nao siga o roteiro antes de resolver."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "00.2 — Health da Webhook API",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// Se este falhar, as avaliacoes ainda rodam — so nao ha entrega.",
                  "// O evento fica no topico e o DeliveryReconciliationJob recupera depois."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Confere que os dois deployables estao no ar antes de comecar.\n\nRisk Engine em 8080, Webhook API em 8082 (portas do docker-compose)."
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Webhook (registrar ANTES da primeira avaliacao)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01.1 — Registrar endpoint do tenant (captura o segredo)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/v1/webhook-endpoints/{{tenantId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "webhook-endpoints",
                "{{tenantId}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"targetUrl\": \"{{ngrokUrl}}/barrier\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Registra para onde o Barrier entrega o resultado deste tenant.\n\nPreencha `ngrokUrl` no environment com a URL HTTPS que o `ngrok start` imprimiu (ex.: `https://a1b2-c3.ngrok-free.app`), sem barra no final.\n\nSem este registro nao ha entrega: o webhook-api resolve o destino pelo tenantId do evento e, sem linha na tabela, apenas loga. `barrier.webhook.target-url` e fallback de dev e nem sobe em prod (GlobalTargetUrlReadinessGuard)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "// O segredo aparece UMA vez: aqui e na rotacao. O GET nunca o devolve.",
                  "// Guardar na variavel de ambiente e o que permite o receptor local conferir a assinatura.",
                  "if (b.secret) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('webhookSecret', b.secret);",
                  "  console.log('');",
                  "  console.log('Rode o receptor com o segredo:');",
                  "  console.log('  export BARRIER_WEBHOOK_SECRET=\"' + b.secret + '\"');",
                  "  console.log('  python3 tools/webhook-receiver.py');",
                  "  console.log('');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('destino e o tunel do ngrok', () => pm.expect(b.targetUrl).to.include('https://'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "01.2 — Conferir o endpoint registrado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/v1/webhook-endpoints/{{tenantId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "webhook-endpoints",
                "{{tenantId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tem segredo proprio', () => pm.expect(b.secretConfigured).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('ativo', () => pm.expect(b.active).to.be.true);",
                  "// secretConfigured=false significa que a entrega ainda usa o segredo global (dev)."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "01.3 — Listar endpoints de todos os tenants",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/v1/webhook-endpoints",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "webhook-endpoints"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "01.4 — Rotacionar o segredo (opcional)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/v1/webhook-endpoints/{{tenantId}}/rotate-secret",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "webhook-endpoints",
                "{{tenantId}}",
                "rotate-secret"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rotacao com sobreposicao: o segredo anterior continua valido por `barrier.webhook.secret-rotation-overlap` (24h). Rode o receptor com o segredo NOVO e observe que as entregas seguem validas."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('webhookSecret', b.secret);",
                  "console.log('novo segredo; anterior aceito ate ' + b.previousSecretUntil);",
                  "// Durante a janela (24h) a entrega leva DUAS assinaturas:",
                  "// X-Barrier-Signature (novo) e X-Barrier-Signature-Previous (anterior).",
                  "// O receptor local aceita as duas — e assim que a troca acontece sem derrubar entrega."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "01.5 — Remover o endpoint (limpeza)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhookBaseUrl}}/v1/webhook-endpoints/{{tenantId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{webhookBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "webhook-endpoints",
                "{{tenantId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Rode antes do resto.** A entrega e disparada pela conclusao da avaliacao; sem endpoint registrado, o resultado do passo 03 nao chega em lugar nenhum.\n\nPreparacao (dois terminais):\n\n```sh\n# terminal 1 — o receptor que o ngrok expoe\npython3 tools/webhook-receiver.py\n\n# terminal 2 — o tunel\nngrok start barrier-webhook \\\n  --config \"$HOME/Library/Application Support/ngrok/ngrok.yml\" \\\n  --config tools/ngrok.yml\n```\n\nCopie a URL `https://...ngrok-free.app` para a variavel `ngrokUrl` e rode o 01.1. Inspetor das entregas em http://localhost:4040."
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Cadastro do subject (CMN 4.753)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "02.1 — Preencher o cadastro (PUT parcial)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "subjects",
                "{{document}}",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"birthDate\": \"1990-01-01\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Brasileira\",\n  \"occupation\": \"Engenheira\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"Rua A\",\n    \"number\": \"10\",\n    \"complement\": null,\n    \"district\": \"Centro\",\n    \"city\": \"São Paulo\",\n    \"state\": \"SP\",\n    \"zipCode\": \"01000-000\"\n  },\n  \"phone\": \"11912345678\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "O cadastro e **por (subject, tenant)**: cada parceiro tem o seu, e ninguem le o do outro (ADR-0012). O DDD do telefone (11) casa com o estado do endereco (SP) — trocar para um DDD de outro estado faz a `ConsistencyRiskRule` somar ao score."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// Cadastro e progressivo: campo ausente preserva o que ja estava (SubjectProfilePatch).",
                  "// Sem estes campos a avaliacao do passo 03 sai EM_REVISAO por cadastro incompleto —",
                  "// que nao e reprovacao, e o gate de completude da CMN 4.753."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "02.2 — Ler o subject",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "subjects",
                "{{document}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// 404 aqui significa que este tenant nao tem vinculo com o subject —",
                  "// o vinculo nasce do primeiro POST de avaliacao, nao do PUT de cadastro."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cadastro antes da avaliacao: e o que faz o caminho feliz terminar em APROVADO."
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Avaliacao PF — caminho automatico",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "03.1 — Submeter CPF",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"document\": \"111.444.777-35\",\n  \"name\": \"Fulano de Tal\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Responde 202 e processa em background. O `Idempotency-Key` e opcional: com ele, reenviar a mesma requisicao dentro de 24h devolve a avaliacao original com `Idempotency-Replayed: true` em vez de criar outra."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', b.id);",
                  "pm.test('nasce EM_ANALISE', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('EM_ANALISE'));",
                  "console.log('assessmentId =', b.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "03.2 — Consultar o resultado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments",
                "{{assessmentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Se voltar `EM_ANALISE`, repita — o processamento e assincrono.\n\nEsperado com o cadastro do passo 02 preenchido: **APROVADO**. Sem ele: **EM_REVISAO** com um fator listando os campos que faltam."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('status =', b.status, '| risco =', b.riskLevel);",
                  "console.log('factors =', JSON.stringify(b.factors, null, 2));",
                  "if (b.status === 'EM_ANALISE') {",
                  "  console.log('ainda processando — repita em alguns segundos');",
                  "}",
                  "// Neste ponto o webhook ja deve ter chegado no receptor local."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Fluxo completo sem intervencao humana. **Olhe o terminal do receptor** depois do 03.2."
    },
    {
      "name": "04 · Avaliacao PF — revisao humana (EDD)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "04.1 — Submeter CPF de PEP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"document\": \"529.982.247-25\",\n  \"name\": \"Fulano Pep Exemplo\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "PEP nao e impedimento de relacionamento — e gatilho de diligencia reforcada (Circular BCB 3.978). Por isso a `PepRiskRule` forca REVIEW e nunca REJECT."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', b.id);",
                  "pm.test('nasce EM_ANALISE', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('EM_ANALISE'));",
                  "console.log('assessmentId =', b.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "04.2 — Confirmar que caiu em revisao",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments",
                "{{assessmentId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('status =', b.status, '| risco =', b.riskLevel);",
                  "console.log('factors =', JSON.stringify(b.factors, null, 2));",
                  "pm.test('EM_REVISAO', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('EM_REVISAO'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "04.3 — Decidir: APPROVE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/decision",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments",
                "{{assessmentId}}",
                "decision"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"reviewedBy\": \"analista@empresa\",\n  \"reason\": \"EDD concluida, cliente conhecido\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "So vale a partir de EM_REVISAO — em qualquer outro estado responde 409. Grava `reviewedBy`/`reason`/`reviewedAt` e **reemite o evento**, entao o parceiro recebe o desfecho final pelo mesmo canal de sempre."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('status APROVADO', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('APROVADO'));",
                  "pm.test('trilha preenchida', () => pm.expect(b.reviewedBy).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "// A decisao reemite barrier.assessment.completed:",
                  "// o receptor recebe uma SEGUNDA entrega, agora com o desfecho final."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "04.4 — Decidir: REJECT (alternativa ao 04.3)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/decision",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments",
                "{{assessmentId}}",
                "decision"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"REJECT\",\n  \"reviewedBy\": \"analista@empresa\",\n  \"reason\": \"risco acima do apetite\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Rode em vez do 04.3, nao depois: a segunda decisao sobre a mesma",
                  "// avaliacao responde 409 (Assessment.decide exige EM_REVISAO)."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "A fila de EDD. Rode **04.3 ou 04.4**, nunca os dois na mesma avaliacao."
    },
    {
      "name": "05 · Avaliacao PJ (KYB de 1o grau)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "05.1 — Submeter CNPJ",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "assessments"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CNPJ\",\n  \"document\": \"18.236.120/0001-58\",\n  \"name\": \"Nubank\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Exige rede: o `BrasilApiBureauProvider` consulta a BrasilAPI para trazer abertura, CNAE e QSA."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', b.id);",
                  "pm.test('nasce EM_ANALISE', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('EM_ANALISE'));",
                  "console.log('assessmentId =', b.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "05.2 — Ver os fatores de PJ",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
